                "title": "The reason CastleFlexx tests its products for PFAS",
                "content": "<p>PFAS are a group of chemicals that have received increased attention from regulators, consumers, and health organizations. CastleFlexx tests because material transparency matters, especially for products people may use regularly against the body. The tested CastleFlexx sample showed <strong>Total Organic Fluorine (TOF): Not Detected</strong> at the reporting limit shown in the Eurofins report.</p>",
                "disclaimer": "<p>*Testing reflects the submitted sample and the method reported by the laboratory. 'Not detected' means the tested sample did not show detectable Total Organic Fluorine above the reporting limit stated in the report. It does not mean every possible compound is present at absolute zero in every component or future production run.</p>",
                "padding_bottom": 60,
                "padding_bottom_mobile": 20
              },
              "blocks": {}
