                "disclaimer": "<p>*Antimicrobial fabrics are designed to inhibit the growth of certain microorganisms on the material itself. They are not intended to protect users from disease, replace proper cleaning, or provide medical benefits. Regular cleaning according to the product care instructions is still recommended.</p>",
